<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="f-button.svg">
  <title>Pirate Shop Token Clicker</title>
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box}body{min-height:100vh;margin:0;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:#f4f4f5;color:#18181b;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}#reset-progress{position:fixed;z-index:11;top:14px;left:14px;padding:10px 14px;border:2px solid #991b1b;border-radius:8px;background:#dc2626;color:white;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800}#reset-progress:hover{background:#b91c1c}main{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:12px;transition:opacity 60s linear,filter 60s linear,scale 60s linear}#count{margin:0;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700}#action-button{width:min(60vw,240px);aspect-ratio:1;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;transition:transform 150ms ease}#action-button:hover{transform:scale(1.05)}#action-button:active{transform:scale(.97)}#action-button img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}#timer-label{max-width:min(90vw,420px);margin:0;text-align:center;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:650}.drawer{position:fixed;z-index:3;width:min(360px,calc(100vw - 48px));padding:20px;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #18181b2e;transition:transform 350ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),opacity 60s linear,filter 60s linear,scale 60s linear}#rebirth-drawer{top:50%;left:0;border-left:0;border-radius:0 16px 16px 0;transform:translate(-100%,-50%)}#rebirth-drawer.open{transform:translate(0,-50%)}.edge-toggle{position:absolute;display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:52px;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;background:white;font-size:1.5rem}#rebirth-toggle{top:20px;right:-44px;border-left:0;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;box-shadow:6px 6px 18px #18181b1a}.rebirth-list{display:grid;gap:10px}.bubble{padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;font-weight:650}.bubble p{margin:0}.bubble small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#52525b;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500}.auto-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.toggle-button{min-width:90px;padding:11px 14px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#dc2626;color:white;font-weight:750}.toggle-button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#16a34a}#access-drawer{right:0;bottom:0;padding:18px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;border-radius:16px 0 0 0;transform:translate(100%,100%)}#access-drawer.open{transform:translate(0,0)}#access-toggle{top:-50px;left:-50px;width:50px;height:50px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;border-radius:14px 0 0 0;box-shadow:-6px -6px 18px #18181b1a}.rainbow{display:inline-block;animation:rainbow 2s linear infinite}@keyframes rainbow{0%{color:#ef4444}17%{color:#f97316}33%{color:#eab308}50%{color:#22c55e}67%{color:#3b82f6}83%{color:#a855f7}100%{color:#ef4444}}.access-content{display:grid;gap:10px;max-height:min(65vh,520px);overflow:auto}.panel-heading{margin:0;font-size:1rem}.password-box{display:grid;gap:10px}#password-display{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:9px;background:#fafafa;font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:.45em;text-align:center}.keypad{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:7px}.keypad button{min-height:44px;border:1px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:8px;background:#f4f4f5;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700}.keypad button:hover{background:#e4e4e7}.password-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}.password-actions button,.bonus-button{flex:1;padding:10px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;font-weight:700}.password-actions .clear-key{background:#71717a}#password-error{min-height:1.2em;margin:0;color:#dc2626;font-size:.85rem}#private-tools{display:none;gap:9px}#private-tools.unlocked{display:grid}.bonus-button{width:100%}.fact-popup{position:fixed;z-index:5;width:min(240px,calc(100vw - 16px));overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #cbd0d8;border-radius:9px;background:white;color:#272a30;box-shadow:0 8px 26px #0003;animation:popup-appear 180ms ease-out;transition:opacity 60s linear,filter 60s linear,scale 60s linear}.fact-bar{min-height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 5px 4px 10px;background:#e5e7eb;cursor:grab;touch-action:none;user-select:none}.fact-bar:active{cursor:grabbing}.fact-tab{margin-right:auto;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:650}.fact-close{width:26px;height:26px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:transparent;font-size:1.1rem}.fact-close:hover{background:#dc2626;color:#fff}.fact-body{min-height:92px;display:grid;align-content:center;padding:14px;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.45}.fact-body p{margin:0}#celebration-layer{position:fixed;z-index:8;inset:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none}.confetti{position:absolute;top:-18px;width:10px;height:16px;animation:confetti-fall 3s linear forwards}@keyframes confetti-fall{to{transform:translate3d(var(--drift),110vh,0) rotate(900deg);opacity:.8}}body.celebrating #action-button{animation:party 500ms ease-in-out infinite alternate}@keyframes party{to{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 24px #facc15);transform:scale(1.07) rotate(4deg)}}body.shutdown .collapsible{opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);scale:.03;pointer-events:none}body.shutdown::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;pointer-events:none;background:rgba(220,38,38,0);animation:shutdown-flash 2s infinite}@keyframes shutdown-flash{0%,12%{background:rgba(220,38,38,.52)}13%,100%{background:rgba(220,38,38,0)}}#clock-toggle{position:fixed;z-index:11;top:14px;right:14px;width:48px;height:48px;border:1px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:14px;background:white;font-size:1.4rem;box-shadow:0 6px 18px #0002}#time-panel{position:fixed;z-index:12;top:70px;right:14px;display:none;width:min(350px,calc(100vw - 28px));padding:14px;border:1px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:14px;background:white;box-shadow:0 10px 28px #0003}#time-panel.open{display:block}#time-panel p{margin:0;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5}#event-status{position:fixed;z-index:10;right:12px;bottom:12px;left:12px;margin:0 auto;width:fit-content;max-width:calc(100vw - 24px);padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:12px;background:#fffffff0;text-align:center;font-weight:750;box-shadow:0 4px 18px #0002}#restore-flash{position:fixed;z-index:9;inset:0;background:white;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}#restore-flash.flash{animation:restore-flash 800ms ease-out}@keyframes restore-flash{0%{opacity:0}35%{opacity:.9}100%{opacity:0}}@keyframes popup-appear{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.96)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}.reset-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:30;display:none;place-items:center;padding:16px;background:#18181b77;backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}.reset-backdrop.open{display:grid}.reset-dialog{width:min(560px,calc(100vw - 28px));padding:22px;border:1px solid #d4d4d8;border-radius:22px;background:white;box-shadow:0 22px 65px #0006;text-align:center}.reset-dialog h2{margin:0 0 12px}.reset-blur{margin:12px 0 18px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.5;filter:blur(3px);user-select:none}.reset-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.confirm-btn{min-width:130px;padding:12px 16px;border:0;border-radius:10px;font-weight:750}.confirm-yes{background:#16a34a;color:#fff}.confirm-no{background:#71717a;color:#fff}.confirm-btn:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.final-dialog{position:fixed;z-index:40;inset:50% auto auto 50%;display:none;width:min(680px,calc(100vw - 28px));padding:24px;border:2px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:28px;background:white;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 25px 70px #0008;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.final-dialog.open{display:block}.final-dialog h2{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,2.4rem);line-height:1.25}.final-dialog .reset-actions{align-items:stretch}.final-dialog .confirm-btn{flex:1;min-width:210px;line-height:1.35}@media(max-width:600px){.reset-actions{flex-direction:column}.confirm-btn{width:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{transition-duration:.01ms!important;animation-duration:.01ms!important}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <button class="collapsible" id="reset-progress" type="button">RESET ALL PROGRESS</button>
  <button class="collapsible" id="clock-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show time played" aria-expanded="false">🕒</button>
  <section id="time-panel" class="collapsible" aria-live="polite"><p id="time-played">Time Played: 0 days, 0 hours, 0 minutes, 0 seconds.</p></section>
  <main class="collapsible">
    <p id="count" aria-live="polite">Clicks: 0</p>
    <button id="action-button" type="button" aria-label="Click the F emblem"><img src="f-button.svg" alt="Golden F compass emblem"></button>
    <p id="timer-label" aria-live="polite">10 Seconds | Pirate Shop Token Chance: 1/137,500</p>
  </main>
  <aside class="drawer collapsible" id="rebirth-drawer" aria-label="Rebirth settings">
    <button class="edge-toggle" id="rebirth-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open rebirth panel" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="rebirth-content">›</button>
    <div class="rebirth-list" id="rebirth-content" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="bubble"><p>Rebirth</p><small id="rebirth-count">Rebirths: 0</small></div>
      <div class="bubble"><p>Pirate Shop Token Chance</p><small id="chance-display">1/137,500</small></div>
      <div class="bubble"><p>Pirate Shop Tokens | PERMANENT: <span id="token-count">0</span></p></div>
      <div class="bubble auto-row"><p>Auto rebirth<small>Rebirth every 100 clicks</small></p><button class="toggle-button" id="rebirth-auto" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Auto Off</button></div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <aside class="drawer collapsible" id="access-drawer" aria-label="Tyran's panel only">
    <button class="edge-toggle" id="access-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open tyran's panel only" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="access-content"><span class="rainbow" aria-hidden="true">↖</span></button>
    <div class="access-content" id="access-content" aria-hidden="true">
      <h2 class="panel-heading">tyran's panel only</h2>
      <div class="password-box" id="password-box">
        <input id="password-display" type="password" aria-label="Four-digit password" placeholder="Enter 4-digit code" readonly inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" maxlength="4">
        <div class="keypad" id="keypad" aria-label="Numeric keypad"></div>
        <div class="password-actions"><button class="clear-key" id="password-clear" type="button">Clear</button><button id="password-submit" type="button">Enter</button></div>
        <p id="password-error" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
      <div id="private-tools">
        <div class="bubble auto-row"><p>Autoclicker<small>Use only if needed</small></p><button class="toggle-button" id="clicker-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Off</button></div>
        <button class="bonus-button" type="button" data-add="1000">Add 1,000 Clicks</button>
        <button class="bonus-button" type="button" data-add="10000">Add 10,000 Clicks</button>
        <button class="bonus-button" type="button" data-add="100000">Add 100,000 Clicks</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <div id="celebration-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <p id="event-status" aria-live="polite">10 Seconds | Pirate Shop Token Chance: 1/137,500</p>
  <div id="restore-flash" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="reset-backdrop" id="reset-backdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"><section class="reset-dialog" id="reset-dialog"></section></div>
  <section class="final-dialog" id="final-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"></section>
  <script>
    const SAVE_KEY='click-counter-save',TIME_KEY='click-counter-time',BASE_TOKEN_ODDS=137500,PASSWORD='3516';
    let clicks=0,rebirths=0,pirateTokens=0,autoRebirth=false,autoclicker=false,autoclickerTimer=null,phase='rolling',countdown=10,phaseTimer=null,previousFactIndex=-1,timePlayed=0,lastTimeTick=Date.now(),shutdownAlertTimer=null,shutdownAudioContext=null;
    try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(SAVE_KEY)||'null');if(saved&&Number.isSafeInteger(saved.clicks)&&saved.clicks>=0)clicks=saved.clicks;if(saved&&Number.isSafeInteger(saved.rebirths)&&saved.rebirths>=0)rebirths=saved.rebirths;if(saved&&Number.isSafeInteger(saved.pirateTokens)&&saved.pirateTokens>=0)pirateTokens=saved.pirateTokens;if(saved&&typeof saved.autoRebirth==='boolean')autoRebirth=saved.autoRebirth;const time=Number(localStorage.getItem(TIME_KEY));if(Number.isFinite(time)&&time>=0)timePlayed=time}catch(e){console.warn('Could not load saved progress.',e)}
    const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),tokenOdds=()=>Math.max(1,BASE_TOKEN_ODDS-rebirths*1001);
    function saveGame(){try{localStorage.setItem(SAVE_KEY,JSON.stringify({clicks,rebirths,pirateTokens,autoRebirth}));localStorage.setItem(TIME_KEY,String(Math.floor(timePlayed)))}catch(e){console.warn('Could not save progress.',e)}}
    function formatPlayedTime(total){const n=Math.max(0,Math.floor(total)),d=Math.floor(n/86400),h=Math.floor(n%86400/3600),m=Math.floor(n%3600/60),s=n%60;return `Time Played: ${d} days, ${h} hours, ${m} minutes, ${s} seconds.`}
    function updateUI(){$('#count').textContent=`Clicks: ${clicks.toLocaleString()}`;$('#rebirth-count').textContent=`Rebirths: ${rebirths.toLocaleString()}`;$('#token-count').textContent=pirateTokens.toLocaleString();$('#chance-display').textContent=`1/${tokenOdds().toLocaleString()}`;$('#rebirth-auto').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(autoRebirth));$('#rebirth-auto').textContent=autoRebirth?'Auto On':'Auto Off';$('#clicker-toggle').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(autoclicker));$('#clicker-toggle').textContent=autoclicker?'On':'Off';$('#time-played').textContent=formatPlayedTime(timePlayed)}
    const soundPresets=[['sawtooth',[110,55,82]],['square',[660,880,1320]],['triangle',[440,330,220]],['sine',[880,660,990]],['square',[196,392,784]],['sawtooth',[130,196,98]],['triangle',[523,659,784]],['sine',[262,330,392]],['square',[740,587,880]],['triangle',[294,370,494]],['sawtooth',[165,247,330]],['sine',[392,523,659]],['square',[587,784,1047]],['triangle',[349,440,587]],['sawtooth',[98,147,196]],['sine',[784,659,523]],['square',[440,880,440]],['triangle',[220,440,660]],['sawtooth',[147,220,294]],['sine',[330,494,659]],['square',[523,392,784]],['triangle',[659,523,392]],['sawtooth',[82,123,164]],['sine',[1047,784,523]]];
    function playRandomClickSound(){try{const AC=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext;if(!AC)return;const ctx=new AC(),now=ctx.currentTime,p=soundPresets[Math.floor(Math.random()*soundPresets.length)];p[1].forEach((freq,i)=>{const osc=ctx.createOscillator(),gain=ctx.createGain(),start=now+i*.105,duration=.09+.04*i;osc.type=p[0];osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(freq,start);gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,start);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.12,start+.015);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,start+duration);osc.connect(gain);gain.connect(ctx.destination);osc.start(start);osc.stop(start+duration+.02)});setTimeout(()=>ctx.close(),900)}catch(e){}}
    function playShutdownWarning(){try{const AC=window.AudioContext||window.webkitAudioContext;if(!AC)return;if(!shutdownAudioContext)shutdownAudioContext=new AC();shutdownAudioContext.resume().catch(()=>{});const now=shutdownAudioContext.currentTime;[880,660].forEach((freq,i)=>{const osc=shutdownAudioContext.createOscillator(),gain=shutdownAudioContext.createGain(),start=now+i*.3;osc.type='square';osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(freq,start);gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,start);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.18,start+.025);gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.18,start+.2);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,start+.28);osc.connect(gain);gain.connect(shutdownAudioContext.destination);osc.start(start);osc.stop(start+.3)})}catch(e){}}
    function stopShutdownWarning(){if(shutdownAlertTimer!==null){clearInterval(shutdownAlertTimer);shutdownAlertTimer=null}}
    function setDrawer(ds,bs,cs,openLabel,closeLabel){const drawer=$(ds),button=$(bs),content=$(cs),open=drawer.classList.toggle('open');button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));button.setAttribute('aria-label',open?closeLabel:openLabel);content.setAttribute('aria-hidden',String(!open));if(bs==='#rebirth-toggle')button.textContent=open?'‹':'›'}
    $('#rebirth-toggle').addEventListener('click',()=>setDrawer('#rebirth-drawer','#rebirth-toggle','#rebirth-content','Open rebirth panel','Close rebirth panel'));
    $('#access-toggle').addEventListener('click',()=>setDrawer('#access-drawer','#access-toggle','#access-content',"Open tyran's panel only","Close tyran's panel only"));
    $('#clock-toggle').addEventListener('click',()=>{const p=$('#time-panel'),open=p.classList.toggle('open');$('#clock-toggle').setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open))});
    $('#action-button').addEventListener('click',()=>{playRandomClickSound();awardClicks(1)});
    $('#rebirth-auto').addEventListener('click',()=>{autoRebirth=!autoRebirth;if(autoRebirth){const earned=Math.floor(clicks/100);clicks%=100;rebirths+=earned}updateUI();saveGame()});
    function restartAutoclicker(){if(autoclickerTimer!==null)clearInterval(autoclickerTimer);autoclickerTimer=autoclicker?setInterval(()=>awardClicks(1),100):null}
    $('#clicker-toggle').addEventListener('click',()=>{autoclicker=!autoclicker;restartAutoclicker();updateUI();saveGame()});
    document.querySelectorAll('.bonus-button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>awardClicks(Number(b.dataset.add))));
    ['1','2','3','4','5','6','7','8','9','⌫','0','↵'].forEach(v=>{const key=document.createElement('button');key.type='button';key.textContent=v;key.setAttribute('aria-label',v==='⌫'?'Backspace':v==='↵'?'Enter code':v);key.addEventListener('click',()=>{const input=$('#password-display');if(v==='⌫')input.value=input.value.slice(0,-1);else if(v==='↵')$('#password-submit').click();else if(input.value.length<4)input.value+=v;$('#password-error').textContent=''});$('#keypad').append(key)});
    $('#password-clear').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#password-display').value='';$('#password-error').textContent=''});
    $('#password-submit').addEventListener('click',()=>{if($('#password-display').value===PASSWORD){$('#password-box').style.display='none';$('#private-tools').classList.add('unlocked');$('#password-error').textContent=''}else{$('#password-display').value='';$('#password-error').textContent='Incorrect code. Enter the four-digit code again.'}});

    const resetBackdrop=$('#reset-backdrop'),resetDialog=$('#reset-dialog'),finalDialog=$('#final-dialog');let firstTimer=null,secondTimer=null;
    function closeReset(){resetBackdrop.classList.remove('open');finalDialog.classList.remove('open');if(firstTimer){clearInterval(firstTimer);firstTimer=null}if(secondTimer){clearInterval(secondTimer);secondTimer=null}}
    function startCountdown(button,label,done){let seconds=10;button.disabled=true;button.textContent=`${label} (${seconds})`;const timer=setInterval(()=>{seconds--;if(seconds<=0){clearInterval(timer);button.disabled=false;button.textContent=label;done(null);return}button.textContent=`${label} (${seconds})`},1000);return timer}
    function resetTemporaryProgress(){clicks=0;rebirths=0;autoRebirth=false;autoclicker=false;restartAutoclicker();updateUI();saveGame()}
    function openFinalConfirmation(){resetBackdrop.classList.remove('open');finalDialog.innerHTML='<h2 id="final-heading">Reset ALL Progress?<br>Pirate Shop Tokens Will Be Deleted.</h2><p class="reset-blur">This cannot be undone. Choose carefully.</p><div class="reset-actions"><button class="confirm-btn confirm-yes" id="final-yes" type="button">Yes (Reset All Progress) (10)</button><button class="confirm-btn confirm-no" id="final-no" type="button">No (Delete Everything Except Time Played &amp; Pirate Shop Tokens)</button></div>';finalDialog.classList.add('open');const yes=$('#final-yes');secondTimer=startCountdown(yes,'Yes (Reset All Progress)',()=>{secondTimer=null});yes.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(yes.disabled)return;resetTemporaryProgress();pirateTokens=0;updateUI();saveGame();closeReset()});$('#final-no').addEventListener('click',()=>{resetTemporaryProgress();closeReset()})}
    $('#reset-progress').addEventListener('click',()=>{resetDialog.innerHTML='<h2 id="reset-heading">Reset Progress?</h2><p class="reset-blur">Continue to reset options. Time played is always kept. Pirate Shop Tokens can be preserved on the next screen.</p><div class="reset-actions"><button class="confirm-btn confirm-yes" id="first-yes" type="button">Yes (10)</button><button class="confirm-btn confirm-no" id="first-no" type="button">No</button></div>';resetBackdrop.classList.add('open');const yes=$('#first-yes');firstTimer=startCountdown(yes,'Yes',()=>{firstTimer=null});yes.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(yes.disabled)return;openFinalConfirmation()});$('#first-no').addEventListener('click',closeReset)});
    document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeReset()});

    const facts=[
      'Octopuses have three hearts, and two stop beating while they swim.','A group of flamingos is called a flamboyance.','Bananas are berries, but strawberries are not.','The Moon moves away from Earth by about 3.8 centimeters each year.','Wombat poop is cube-shaped.','A day on Venus is longer than its year.','Honey can remain edible for thousands of years when sealed well.','Sea otters sometimes hold hands while they sleep so they do not drift apart.','The Eiffel Tower can grow taller in hot weather as its metal expands.','Some turtles can breathe through specialized tissues in their rear ends.',
      'The dot over a lowercase i or j is called a tittle.','A group of crows is sometimes called a murder.','Sharks existed before trees.','Saturn would float in water if a large enough ocean existed.','Koala fingerprints look remarkably similar to human fingerprints.','The shortest war on record lasted less than an hour.','A newborn kangaroo is about the size of a lima bean.','The human nose can detect many different odors.','An ostrich eye is larger than its brain.','Butterflies taste with sensors on their feet.',
      'Some cats chirp when watching birds.','The word alphabet comes from the Greek letters alpha and beta.','A cloud can weigh hundreds of tonnes.','Cows have best friends and can become stressed when separated.','The Great Barrier Reef is the world’s largest coral reef system.','A blue whale has a heart roughly the size of a small car.','A shrimp’s heart is located in its head region.','Koala fingerprints can look remarkably like human fingerprints.','The smell after rain is often called petrichor.','A bolt of lightning can be hotter than the surface of the Sun.',
      'There are more possible chess games than atoms in the observable universe.','Some bamboo species can grow very rapidly in a day.','A jiffy is an informal name for a very short time interval.','Many young oranges are green before ripening.','A hummingbird’s heart beats rapidly during flight.','A snail can have thousands of tiny teeth.','Antarctica is the world’s largest desert.','A group of owls is sometimes called a parliament.','Sea stars can regenerate some lost arms.','A giraffe’s tongue can be around 45 centimeters long.',
      'The word muscle comes from a Latin word meaning little mouse.','A day on Jupiter lasts about ten hours.','Some frogs can survive freezing temperatures and thaw in spring.','The Pacific Ocean is larger than all Earth’s land areas combined.','Adult humans usually have 206 bones.','A prism can separate white light into a rainbow of colors.','Some early computer mice were made of wood.','The hashtag symbol is also called an octothorpe.','A group of porcupines is called a prickle.','The bumblebee bat is among the smallest mammals by mass.',
      'Penguins have knees hidden beneath their feathers.','The Amazon rainforest spans several South American countries.','Some mushrooms glow in the dark.','Every person has a unique fingerprint pattern.','A crocodile cannot stick out its tongue.','The word queue is pronounced like the letter Q.','Lightning can travel across the sky for many kilometers.','The English word orange was named after the fruit.','Earth bulges slightly at the equator.','A group of jellyfish may be called a bloom.',
